     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">apparently <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">dir.exists</code> is an R 3.2 function, and not in R 3.1</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">suggest to take out the if/else call using dir.exists in the instructions since if you run dir.create on a folder that already exists, it will just show a warning.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">I’ve tested it on my server but an additional SO reference: <a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/4216753/check-existence-of-directory-and-create-if-doesnt-exist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/4216753/check-existence-of-directory-and-create-if-doesnt-exist&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464156231000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Izu7wH2gUd_9Qa0Cg-aSx\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/4216753/check-existence-of-directory-and-create-if-doesnt-exist</a></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:YXBwYXJlbnRseSBgZGlyLmV4aXN0c2AgaXMgYW4gUiAzLjIgZnVuY3Rpb24sIGFuZCBub3QgaW4g\r\nUiAzLjE8ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PnN1Z2dlc3QgdG8gdGFrZSBvdXQgdGhlIGlmL2Vsc2Ug\r\nY2FsbCB1c2luZyBkaXIuZXhpc3RzIGluIHRoZSBpbnN0cnVjdGlvbnMgc2luY2UgaWYgeW91IHJ1\r\nbiBkaXIuY3JlYXRlIG9uIGEgZm9sZGVyIHRoYXQgYWxyZWFkeSBleGlzdHMsIGl0IHdpbGwganVz\r\ndCBzaG93IGEgd2FybmluZy48L2Rpdj48ZGl2Pjxicj48L2Rpdj48ZGl2PkkndmUgdGVzdGVkIGl0\r\nIG9uIG15IHNlcnZlciBidXQgYW4gYWRkaXRpb25hbCBTTyByZWZlcmVuY2U6Jm5ic3A7aHR0cDov\r\nL3N0YWNrb3ZlcmZsb3cuY29tL3F1ZXN0aW9ucy80MjE2NzUzL2NoZWNrLWV4aXN0ZW5jZS1vZi1k\r\naXJlY3RvcnktYW5kLWNyZWF0ZS1pZi1kb2VzbnQtZXhpc3Q8L2Rpdj4=\" style=\"min-height:0;width:0;max-height:0;max-width:0;overflow:hidden;font-size:0em;padding:0;margin:0\">​</div></div></div>\r\n"
